'''Divine Archangel Strikes''' (大天使エクスエル強襲 ''Daitenshi Ekusueru Kyōshū!'', '''Archangel Exel's Assault!''') is an event added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Divine Archangel Strikes will reset when the event ends, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returns. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Archangel Exiel]], a variant of [[Mr. Angel]] with higher range, long-reaching Omni Strikes, and a 100% chance to weaken and warp Cat Units.

==Overview==
===About===
Divine Archangel Strikes contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, each called '''Blessing'''. After beating a level, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of a level can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]] and [[Ototo Corps|Materials]]. Every 10 levels plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Divine Archangel Strikes/Blessing Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Divine Archangel Strikes is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

